{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17739","headline":"早春即事呈刘员外 · 杨巨源","name":"早春即事呈刘员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明朝晴暖即相随，肯信春光被雨欺。\n且任文书堆案上，免令杯酒负花时。\n马蹄经历须应徧，莺语叮咛已怪迟。\n更待杂芳成艳锦，邺中争唱仲宣诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}